      "content": "it's not just about the money though. it's the fact that there's no end in sight. even if i find a counselor or a better job, the math stays the same. the more i try to \"get ahead\", the more things just cost more. it feels less like a problem to solve and more like a loop i'm stuck in. like, why am i even fighting so hard just to stay at zero? it feels so pointless.",
